
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>InfoHub</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
      background: #f3f0ff;
      color: #29213d;
    }
    header {
      background: #30245b;
      color: white;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav {
      background: #49387e;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
    }
    nav a {
      color: white;
      margin: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
    }
    main {
      padding: 20px;
    }
    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 18px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }
    h2 { color: #49387e; }
    footer {
      background: #30245b;
      color: white;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header>
    <h1>InfoHub</h1>
    <p>Knowledge for Everyday Life</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#education">Education</a>
    <a href="#technology">Technology</a>
    <a href="#about">About</a>
  </nav>

  <main id="home">
    <h2>Welcome to InfoHub!</h2>
    <p>Your source of useful information and knowledge.</p>

    <div class="card" id="education">
      <h2>Education</h2>
      <p>Discover study tips, learning resources and revision notes.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="technology">
      <h2>Technology</h2>
      <p>Learn about computers, the internet and digital skills.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Health & Lifestyle</h2>
      <p>Explore general wellness and everyday living tips.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card" id="about">
      <h2>About Us</h2>
      <p>InfoHub makes useful information easier to discover.</p>
    </div>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 InfoHub</p>
  </footer>
</body>
</html>
